icense":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"AIZAkjCKJpcb8D8M","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689026543557,"modifiedTime":1689026572377,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Feed the Heart","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The ribcage vine has a creature @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Grabbed]{Grabbed}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The ribcage vine feeds on the vital essence of the creature. The grabbed creature takes @Damage[2d8[void]] damage, with a basic @Check[type:fortitude|dc:22] save, and the ribcage vine regains a number of Hit Points equal to the damage taken.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"K3O4x8BZM9tTt4le","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689026580533,"modifiedTime":1691261012753,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Protect the Heart","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The ribcage vine assumes a more defensive position, using its hard leaves to protect its core, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to AC until the beginning of its next turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-su-effects.Item.1u27q7skD0m4LMwl]{Effect: Protect The Heart}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"RNjsiNjzsREqJjUj","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.1","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689026580948,"modifiedTime":1689026836694,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Root Disruption","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The ribcage vine uses its roots to churn and roil the earth, exposing a mass of sharp bones @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Hidden]{Hidden} underneath. Each of the ribcage vine's enemies within its mud and bones aura takes @Damage[2d8[slashing]] damage, depending on a @Check[type:reflex|dc:21] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature avoids the bones and is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage from the bones.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage from the bones, as well as [[/r 1d6[persistent,bleed]]] damage as bone fragments become embedded in their flesh or leave gaping wounds behind.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the creature is also knocked @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Prone]{Prone} by the violent churning of the earth.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_m